what should I do,
save the children

261
00:31:07.775 --> 00:31:10.025
or should I focus on boobs?

262
00:31:10.027 --> 00:31:11.986
Well we can do both.

263
00:31:11.988 --> 00:31:14.030
Stacy, we're only human.

264
00:31:14.032 --> 00:31:17.824
