324
00:36:08.076 --> 00:36:09.491
Well that's perfect.

325
00:36:09.493 --> 00:36:12.745
Do you remember I had to get
that plane ticket to Iowa?

326
00:36:12.747 --> 00:36:13.703
Where?

327
00:36:13.705 --> 00:36:16.373
The Ottumwa Iowa
film festival,

328
