or something?

369
00:38:43.480 --> 00:38:44.357
No.

370
00:38:46.526 --> 00:38:48.986
He wanted me to be a princess.

371
00:38:50.654 --> 00:38:52.156
So misogynistic.

372
00:38:53.448 --> 00:38:55.658
Just sounds like another
way to dominate women.

373
